[00:35.000]
[01:51.010]Some days feel like nothing.
[01:57.400]The winds come and gently pass me...
[02:00.490]And so I feel alone.
[02:03.010]
[02:04.180]Lately, I've been wondering.
[02:10.560]But what could it be, I'm finding…
[02:13.890]Something's probably missing inside me.
[02:17.110]
[02:17.610]Wanna hold you close.
[02:19.540]Take you everywhere.
[02:21.990]Life's too short to care.
[02:23.540]Yet, it's not a game.
[02:26.120]Lift your hands to break
[02:27.690]Liminality.
[02:32.120]
[02:37.660]No matter what the others have said
[02:41.120]Or the lies we all have read.
[02:44.770]Just turn around
[02:46.540]And you'll be found in time. (The magic is still inside.)
[02:51.720]Don't mind the pain. In the end, it might be somewhat strange.
[02:57.910]You're not alone. Not on your own.
[03:01.220]Just break away...
[03:05.000]
[03:08.420]Maybe I was careless.
[03:14.280]But that's what makes us human.
[03:17.860]And so, we learn from it.
[03:20.260]
[03:21.560]Sometimes I get blinded.
[03:28.020]And yet I can't stop from trying again.
[03:31.490]Every thought begins to drive me.
[03:34.460]
[03:34.960]Come and count to three.
[03:36.950]Open up your mind.
[03:39.340]Letting out your dreams.
[03:41.080]Reaching to the stars.
[03:43.480]Open up and soar.
[03:45.200]We'll go anywhere.
[03:49.170]
[03:55.080]But even if we're torn far apart,
[03:58.530]You know you're still inside my heart.
[04:02.240]Though life is hard,
[04:03.940]You offered up your hand. (I'll always be waiting here.)
[04:09.210]"Wish you were mine..."
[04:12.050]Were the thoughts I had inside.
[04:15.600]I don't know when I'll see the end.
[04:18.790]It fades away.
[04:22.340]
